1
00:05:37,500 --> 00:05:43,500
Christmas at the Chalet is a tv movie, romance,
comedy film directed by Lucie Guest.

2
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:21,000
When ex TV host and socialite Lex finds herself faced with the possibility of spending Christmas sharing a luxury chalet with her son, ex husband and his new girlfriend, she
volunteers to work in the chalet to avoid things getting too close to home, while documenting her every move for a new wave of followers loving this new chapter of her life.

