9
00:50:37,500 --> 00:50:43,500
Chalet Girl is a 2011 romantic comedy sports film directed by Phil Traill.

10
00:56:15,000 --> 00:56:21,000
The film stars Felicity Jones and Ed Westwick in the lead roles and also features Ken Duken,
Tamsin Egerton, Sophia Bush, Bill Bailey, Brooke Shields, and Bill Nighy.

11
01:01:52,500 --> 01:01:58,500
Written by Tom Williams, the film was produced by Pippa Cross,
Harriet Rees, Dietmar Guentsche, and Wolfgang Behr.

12
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
Chalet Girl was filmed on location in Sankt Anton am Arlberg,
Austria, and in Garmisch-Partenkirchen, Germany.

13
01:13:07,500 --> 01:13:13,500
While critical reaction to the film was mixed, Jones' performance was praised.

14
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The film grossed US$5.5 million worldwide against an
£8 million (US$13 million) budget.

15
01:24:22,500 --> 01:24:28,500
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
